# Scratch files written into the working directory by the physics backends.
# xtb's GFN-FF dumps its topology and adjacency tables on every initialisation,
# and PySCF writes temporary HDF5 scratch; all of it is regenerated per run and
# none of it is an input to anything.
gfnff_topo
gfnff_adjacency
gfnff_charges
charges
wbo
xtbrestart
xtbtopo.mol
.xtboptok
xtb*.log
tmp*.h5
*.molden
